      "versionNonce": 1384609340,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1743098131232,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Responsibilities \n- consistency: lock, thread\n  safe, eviction, limited \n  memory.\n..........................................\n- case are simple here inmemory cache would work.\n- since its sync -> read/write.\n- then we can use different cache invalidation tech.\n  as per our usecase.\n- scale: either put that in redis. and make stateless\n- horizontal + invalidate cache at read. ( in prefix or quadtree as well)\n- figure out way to partition data to multiple different pods.\n- or sticky load balancing. \n................................................\n- deploy -> blue/green , \n  canary ",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Responsibilities \n- consistency: lock, thread\n  safe, eviction, limited \n  memory.\n..........................................\n- case are simple here inmemory cache would work.\n- since its sync -> read/write.\n- then we can use different cache invalidation tech.\n  as per our usecase.\n- scale: either put that in redis. and make stateless\n- horizontal + invalidate cache at read. ( in prefix or quadtree as well)\n- figure out way to partition data to multiple different pods.\n- or sticky load balancing. \n................................................\n- deploy -> blue/green , \n  canary ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
